    {
      "text": "It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "With noises that could be mistaken for the rattles of maracas, it creates an upbeat rhythm, startling bird Pokémon and making them fly off in a hurry.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. They’re jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
